+# Uri-flavoured Mastodon — Agent Instructions
+
+## Dev Container
+
+**REQUIRED STEP:** At the start of every session, confirm whether you are running inside a dev container (check for `/.dockerenv`). If you are, read `.devcontainer/welcome-message.txt` and apply any relevant guidance from it before proceeding.
+
+### Environment Summary (from welcome-message.txt)
+
+- **Start the application:** `bin/dev`
+- **Run the test suite:** `RAILS_ENV=test bin/rails assets:precompile && RAILS_ENV=test bin/rspec`
+- All required software is pre-installed in the container.
